# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:4
translate tr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8d7cfe15:

    # "Littered about the place were various strange and extraordinary items his brother had collected over the years that clogged up much of the space, hence why me and Markus spent less time here growing up."
    "Etrafa, kardeşinin yıllar boyunca biriktirdiği ve mekanın çoğunu tıkayan çeşitli garip ve olağanüstü eşyalar saçılmıştı, bu yüzden ben ve Markus büyürken burada daha az zaman geçirdik."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:9
translate tr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_209c6d2f:

    # "Entering through a door open ajar, I've realized that I walked into what could be described as a family conversation:"
    "Aralık bir kapıdan girerek, bir aile konuşması olarak tanımlanabilecek şeye yürüdüğümü fark ettim:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:11
translate tr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_340883f3:

    # "It was Skallion, Markus' brother."
    "Bu Skallion'dı, Markus'un kardeşi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:12
translate tr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d6aaf9ed:

    # "Having lost both of his parents during the war, Skallion, who used to live alone, was forced to take the young Markus under his wing."
